    "detailed_description": "Embark on a <strong>spine-chilling</strong> odyssey with &quot;<i>No Ticket Back</i>,&quot; a fusion of<br>horror, roguelike, strategy simulation, zombie survival, tower<br>defense, RPG, crafting and building, and colony builder genres. The SS<br>McCalister's Hope, once a <strong>beacon of hope</strong> bound for Mars, now drifts as<br>a haunted vessel, plagued by the<strong> looming threat of a zombie<br>apocalypse</strong>. Can the crew endure the <strong>nightmarish </strong>onslaught and escape<br>the clutches of their <strong>ghostly ship</strong>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buckle up for an immersive journey into <strong>darkness</strong>, where every decision<br>could mean the difference between life and death. Delve into the rich<br>narrative of the last hope for humanity, as <strong>survivors </strong>of a ravaged<br>Earth seek redemption amidst the stars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/0e94f58a6f08bd1474011c3b8e86bf30.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/0e94f58a6f08bd1474011c3b8e86bf30.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/0e94f58a6f08bd1474011c3b8e86bf30.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><i>&quot;No Ticket Back: Craft, Survive &amp; Escape&quot;</i> is not for the<br>faint-hearted. Navigate treacherous corridors, fend off relentless<br>enemies, and rebuild the colony from the brink of destruction. Can you<br>stem the tide of the <strong>deadly GOO</strong> before it consumes everything in its<br>path?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/733f68e04f1ff86212a478bb4ec86330.avif?t=1742810160\" width=700 height=352 /></span><br><br>Prepare to confront your <strong>deepest fears</strong> in a harrowing struggle<br>for survival, where the line between friend and foe blurs amidst the<br>shadows of the ghost ship. Will you emerge victorious and lead your<br>crew to safety, or will you succumb to the horrors that lurk within?<br>The choice is yours.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/667949e2e15640a9b813205b41e4f6ed.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/667949e2e15640a9b813205b41e4f6ed.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on the Abyss: Explore the Depths of 'No Ticket Back</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft &amp; Build</h2> Uncover the secrets of deadly traps, walls, and towers<br>as you confront the encroaching darkness, fortifying your defenses to<br><strong>withstand the horrors</strong> that prowl the night. Embark on a Story-Rich<br>Journey to the Interstellar Promised Land amidst the haunting<br>mysteries of space.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/fe6403a628951ebcd1f8a0bb531194fb.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/fe6403a628951ebcd1f8a0bb531194fb.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colony Simulator:</h2> Rebuild your <strong>shattered colony </strong>amidst the shadows of<br>the ghost ship, where every decision shapes the fate of your fellow<br>survivors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management:</h2> Scavenge for gold, construct vital habitats and<br>greenhouses, and maintain a delicate balance of food, power, and<br>wealth to sustain the dwindling hopes of your crew. But beware: in the<br>depths of space, danger lurks in every shadow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/091f14f8368f5209722338e4995f073b.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/091f14f8368f5209722338e4995f073b.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/091f14f8368f5209722338e4995f073b.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie Survival:</h2> Brace yourself for the relentless onslaught of the<br>undead, as the ghost ship awakens with a hunger for flesh and blood.<br>Only by fortifying your defenses during the fleeting daylight hours<br>can you hope to <strong>survive the horrors </strong>that lurk in the night.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/1d38f867765d95682517a15c2a16b031.avif?t=1742810160\" width=700 height=326 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2> Dare to venture into the forsaken depths of the derelict<br>spacecraft, where untold mysteries lie waiting to be uncovered.<br>Explore the remains of the abandoned parts of the spacecraft in a<br>third-person roguelite style, armed with powerful weapons and power<br>jump tricks. But be warned: in the <strong>darkness</strong>, whispers echo, and<br>nightmares come to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/8c8e8b94fb4384cb1bdd4dca21632784.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/8c8e8b94fb4384cb1bdd4dca21632784.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/8c8e8b94fb4384cb1bdd4dca21632784.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade System</h2> Unlock the secrets of future technologies, enhancing<br>your weapons, armor, and soldiers with newfound power. But with each<br>step towards victory comes the <strong>risk </strong>of awakening forces beyond your<br>control.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colony Management</h2> Navigate the treacherous waters of colony survival,<br>as you struggle to maintain order amidst the chaos. Will you lead with<br>a firm hand, or will your grip falter in the face of insurmountable<br>odds?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/45adea2dc07e5e0efcdfaa722fe2cd36.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/45adea2dc07e5e0efcdfaa722fe2cd36.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/45adea2dc07e5e0efcdfaa722fe2cd36.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror</h2> Immerse yourself in a world of chilling terror, where every<br>creak of the ship and every flicker of light heralds the approach of<br><strong>unspeakable horrors</strong>. Can you withstand the darkness, or will you<br>become lost in its embrace?<br><br>Will you brave the journey of the one-way ticket trip? The call has<br>been made\u2014<strong>will you answer it?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/a24fe6970b5b4a008cc567c539a4c38f.poster.avif?t=1742810160\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/a24fe6970b5b4a008cc567c539a4c38f.webm?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871540/extras/a24fe6970b5b4a008cc567c539a4c38f.mp4?t=1742810160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
